WEBVTT

00:01:29.502 --> 00:01:31.420
You're not. You're fine.

00:01:31.462 --> 00:01:33.506
And here is how life works.

00:01:33.548 --> 00:01:36.342
Life is a form of chemistry.

00:01:36.384 --> 00:01:39.679
A form of chemistry
that explores solutions

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:44.308
in response to the problems
in its own immediate chemical environment.

00:01:45.101 --> 00:01:49.647
Life is a form of chemistry
that retains a memory of these solutions

00:01:49.647 --> 00:01:51.440
over billions of years.

00:01:52.567 --> 00:01:55.403
And life's first solution
was quite the trick:

00:01:55.403 --> 00:01:56.737
copy itself.

00:01:57.363 --> 00:01:58.781
This is astounding.

00:01:58.781 --> 00:02:02.493
We would not be standing here today
if other tricks didn't follow,